is cheaper and easier than you might think – we can get your parcels there in as little as 3 days and from only £6.66. ",[],{"type":88,"text":96,"spans":97,"direction":91},"Need to send more parcels abroad? If you've got packages to France or shipments to send to Italy, we deliver to over 200 countries and territories.",[98,105,107,112],{"start":99,"end":100,"type":101,"data":102},48,66,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":103,"target":104},"berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Ffrance","_self",{"start":99,"end":100,"type":106},"strong",{"start":108,"end":109,"type":101,"data":110},70,96,{"link_type":36,"url":111,"target":104},"berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fitaly",{"start":108,"end":109,"type":106},"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":116,"version":31,"items":117,"primary":198,"id":201,"slice_type":202,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[118,137,149,162,174,186],{"title":119,"content":120,"icon":130},"Regular tracking updates",[121],{"type":88,"text":122,"spans":123,"direction":91},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and email notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[124,129],{"start":125,"end":126,"type":101,"data":127},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":128,"target":104},"berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":125,"end":126,"type":106},{"dimensions":131,"alt":133,"copyright":46,"url":134,"id":135,"edit":136},{"width":132,"height":132},40,"Phone icon","berlin.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":138,"content":139,"icon":143},"Parcel cover",[140],{"type":88,"text":141,"spans":142,"direction":91},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 fo