46},[231],{"type":209,"text":232,"spans":233},"Lockers",[],[235],{"type":88,"text":236,"spans":237,"direction":91},"Book your delivery online and visit your nearest Locker, open 24\u002F7 with locations across the UK. Simply scan your barcode and place your parcel into an available Locker, ready for collection.",[],{"dimensions":239,"alt":241,"copyright":46,"url":242,"id":243,"edit":244},{"width":78,"height":240},665,"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","berlin.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":66,"y":245,"zoom":67,"background":68},8,{"link_type":36,"key":247,"url":248},"b44520dd-4aeb-4486-a4a0-4b94a13a4c36","berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":228},{"Title":251,"Description":255,"Image":259,"Label":46,"UrlText":265,"Url":266,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":269,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[252],{"type":209,"text":253,"spans":254},"Couriers",[],[256],{"type":88,"text":257,"spans":258,"direction":91},"Our Couriers can collect parcels from your home or workplace. Book your collection online and pick a convenient day. We'll provide a one-hour window for when we'll arrive to collect your parcel.",[],{"dimensions":260,"alt":261,"copyright":46,"url":262,"id":263,"edit":264},{"width":78,"height":240},"A customer has just handed their parcel to an Evri courier as a part of a doorstep collection. The customer is being handed a blue slip as a receipt of the transaction.","berlin.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xsZbqstJ9-pVA_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1545.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8158%2C5425&w=1000&h=665","Z69xsZbqstJ9-pVA",{"x":66,"y":245,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Courier collection",{"link_type":36,"key":267,"url":268},"01520351-fa0c-4b77-a1e7-3a1d9a1a4990","berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":228},{"SectionTitle":271,"SectionDescription":276,"theme":46},[272],{"type":273,"text":274,"spans":275,"direction":91},"heading2","3 easy ways to send a parcel to Berlin with Evri",[],[277],{"type":88,"text":278,"spans":279,"direction":91},"Choose to drop off your parcel at any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops or Lockers, or book a convenient Courier collection from your home:",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":283,"version":31,"items":284,"primary":286,"id":298,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[285],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":287,"CardText":288,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":297,"IsEco":20},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Berlin?",[289],{"type":88,"text":290,"spans":291,"direction":91},"Sending a parcel to Germany usually takes 6 to 9 days.",[292,296],{"start":66,"end":293,"type":101,"data":294},27,{"link_type":36,"url":295,"target":104},"berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fgermany",{"start":66,"end":293,"type":106},{"link_type":228},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":300,"version":31,"items":301,"primary":303,"id":333,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[302],{},{"CardImage":304,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":310,"CardText":311,"ButtonText":330,"ButtonUrl":331,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":305,"alt":306,"copyright":46,"url":307,"id":308,"edit":309},{"width":78,"height":240},"An Evri Courier scanning multiple parcels for a doorstep collection in a block of flats.","berlin.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi",{"x":66,"y":245,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Send multiple parcels to Berlin",[312,315,324,327],{"type":88,"text":313,"spans":314,"direction":91},"Sending multiple parcels or running an international business? Our Bulk Integrations tool simplifies it all. Send several parcels to Berlin and beyond in one go:",[],{"type":316,"text":317,"spans":318,"direction":91},"o-list-item","Log in or create an Evri account and head to our Bulk Integrations tool using our Bulk Send tool. Click ‘Link Account’ to connect your marketplace accounts like eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify, or upload via CSV file.",[319,323],{"start":320,"end":321,"type":101,"data":322},82,97,{"link_type":36,"url":38,"target":104},{"start":320,"end":321,"type":106},{"type":316,"text":325,"spans":326,"direction":91},"Package and book your items online and print off your postage label at home or in-store with our free Print in ParcelShop device",[],{"type":316,"text":328,"spans":329,"direction":91},"Drop off your parcels at any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers, or book a Courier collection.",[],"View integrations",{"link_type":36,"key":332,"url":38},"531db2c2-6f0e-4c5c-961c-b60f8b4c33ce","card$fa303a60-84d8-4787-b754-15518974d525",{"variation":283,"version":31,"items":335,"primary":337,"id":346,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},[336],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":338,"CardText":339,"ButtonText":343,"ButtonUrl":344,"IsEco":20},"Send parcels to Germany",[340],{"type":88,"text":341,"spans":342,"direction":91},"We've created an easy guide for shipping to Germany. Discover what you can and can't send, how national holidays might impact delivery times, and the address details you’ll need for your labels.",[],"Learn more",{"link_type":36,"key":345,"url":295},"db88851c-37f1-4de4-bdc9-6a6e9d9a45f3","card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":300,"version":31,"items":348,"primary":442,"id":444,"slice_type":445,"slice_label":46},[349,380,398,430],{"questionTitle":350,"questionBody":351},"What can I send to Germany?",[352,355,377],{"type":88,"text":353,"spans":354,"direction":91},"When posting parcels to Berlin or further away in Germany, there are some restrictions to be aware of.",[],{"type":88,"text":356,"spans":357,"direction":91},"You can find out which items are not permitted by taking a look at our prohibited items list as well as the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority pages.",[358,364,365,370,371,376],{"start":359,"end":360,"type":101,"data":361},71,92,{"link_type":36,"url":362,"target":363},"\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send","_blank",{"start":359,"end":360,"type":106},{"start":366,"end":367,"type":101,"data":368},108,140,{"link_type":36,"url":369,"target":363},"berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":366,"end":367,"type":106},{"start":372,"end":373,"type":101,"data":374},149,176,{"link_type":36,"url":375,"target":363},"berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":372,"end":373,"type":106},{"type":88,"text":378,"spans":379,"direction":91},"These provide the latest guidelines on items that can’t be sent via airlines.",[],{"questionTitle":381,"questionBody":382},"Will I need to deal with customs when sending to Berlin?",[383,386,389],{"type":88,"text":384,"spans":385,"direction":91},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":88,"text":387,"spans":388,"direction":91},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":88,"text":390,"spans":391,"direction":91},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[392,397],{"start":393,"end":394,"type":101,"data":395},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":396,"target":363},"berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":393,"end":394,"type":106},{"questionTitle":399,"questionBody":400},"Is there import tax from the UK to Berlin?",[401,404,413,416,419,422,425],{"type":209,"text":402,"spans":403,"direction":91},"UK business or marketplace seller? ",[],{"type":88,"text":405,"spans":406,"direction":91},"If you’re an online seller sending goods up to the value of €150 and to a destination within the EU, you might want to use Import One Stop Shop (IOSS). IOSS deals with VAT charges at the point of sale. So, as well as making life simpler for you, it also benefits your recipient - there’ll be no surprise costs for your customer when they receive their goods. Check out our guide on sending parcels to Europe to find out more about IOSS.​",[407,412],{"start":408,"end":409,"type":101,"data":410},382,407,{"link_type":36,"url":411,"target":363},"berlin.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Feurope",{"start":408,"end":409,"type":106},{"type":88,"text":414,"spans":415,"direction":91},"If you haven’t sold through a marketplace or if your parcel destination is outside the EU, remember to let your recipient know they may need to pay customs charges.",[],{"type":209,"text":417,"spans":418,"direction":91},"International standard delivery service",[],{"type":88,"text":420,"spans":421,"direction":91},"If you're using our international standard delivery service, your recipient may need to pay taxes and duties either before your items leave the UK or when the parcel reaches its destination. ",[],{"type":88,"text":423,"spans":424,"direction":91},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":88,"text":390,"spans":426,"direction":91},[427,429],{"start":393,"end":394,"type":101,"data":428},{"link_type":36,"url":396,"target":363},{"start":393,"end":394,"type":106},{"questionTitle":431,"questionBody":432},"Can I track my international parcels?",[433],{"type":88,"text":434,"spans":435,"direction":91},"Yes, you can track all your Evri parcels to Berlin for free. Simply enter your 16-digit tracking number on our tracking page to follow your parcel's progress. Your recipient will also receive email notifications to keep updated on their parcel's progress.",[436,440],{"start":437,"end":438,"type":101,"data":439},111,124,{"link_type":36,"url":128,"target":104},{"start":437,"end":441,"type":106},125,{"title":443},"FAQs about shipping to Berlin","frequently_asked_questions$57fefc8c-b2c9-4081-82a7-95a11a3df31f","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,115,203,282,299,334,347],["Reactive",448],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":449,"$sclients":516,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":519},{"abtasty":450,"accessibe":454,"appPromoBanner":457,"autoDivertUpdates":460,"awin":463,"bulkInternational":466,"bulkSendEnabled":469,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":472,"enableBasketCount":475,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":478,"euCustomsDuty":481,"groovyAdvert":484,"newInternationalSendFlow":487,"newinternationalpages":494,"oohPreferenceFlag":498,"opentel":501,"premium":504,"savedCards":507,"smallParcelSize":510,"yourPricesDrawer":513},{"_createdAt":451,"_updatedAt":452,"enabled":453},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":455,"_updatedAt":456,"enabled":453},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":458,"_updatedAt":459,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":461,"_updatedAt":462,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":464,"_updatedAt":465,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":467,"_updatedAt":468,"enabled":453},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T1